Hi !

I observe a double free on IoT Hub Client on mqtt over websockets.
This happens when the device is deleted from the IoT hub when the client is currently registering.

I have modifed the example **iothub_client_sample_mqtt_websockets** you provide to be able to delete the device with the service client (file **[YOUR_PATH_TO_SDK]/iothub_client/samples/iothub_client_sample_mqtt_websockets/iothub_client_sample_mqtt_ws.c**):


```
// Copyright (c) Microsoft. All rights reserved.
