The sample code below may be used to try out the concept:
- Define a Gateway in your Watson IoT instance
- Update the 4 constants to match your settings
- Run this code as a Java application
- Update the metadata in Watson IoT for the Gateway
- And watch the propertyChangedListener fire
- Restart this Gateway and watch what happens to the metadata you just entered. It is gone.

