System.sleep(5) not turning Wi-Fi back on after 5 seconds.  System.sleep is supposed to turn of Wi-Fi and continue running code, which it does.  However after 5 seconds Wi-Fi is not turned back on and reconnected automatically, which is not stated anywhere but implied with `sleep(5)`.
